'''Nuclear Dragon King Berius''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was exclusive to the VIP [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS Gacha]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

