==Trivia==
*One of the PC version's [http://youtu.be/MKmnzwr6rUg exclusive stages] had an [[Nuclear Dragon King Berius (PC Enemy)|enemy version]] of this unit; its exact stats are currently unknown.
*The design of this unit resembles a [[wikipedia:Lernaean Hydra|Hydra]], a mythological three-headed dragon monster.
*King Berius is likely a reference to the three headed monster [[wikipedia:King Ghidorah|King Ghidorah]] from the Godzilla franchise, as they both share a similar two legged stance and electric capabilities.

